## Source archive contents (git archive / GitHub release tarballs)
##
## vendor/exiftool is a git submodule (see .gitmodules); `git archive` never
## descends into submodule content, so an archive contains only this
## repository's own files plus an empty vendor/exiftool/ directory. The test
## suite and the parity tools need that checkout and are left out of the
## archive; the library itself is self-contained (src/lexiftool/Geolocation.dat
## is a verbatim copy of the vendored database, see LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY).

src/test export-ignore
src/runtests.lua export-ignore
tools export-ignore
standalone export-ignore
